&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e828e8bb9654ec09af1736ebcb18ae73 3x"}, "body": "hello! your art is so pretty! i would love if you would draw my character!\n\n- doctor.\n- 38 years old. \n- heterochromia (right eye is red, left eye is green).\n- long scar over his right eye.\n- two beauty marks, one under each eye. \n- often seen with bruises and bandages across his body.\n- hands are always gloved, and he wears a thick black choker around his neck to conceal a scar.\n- has a tattoo of black flower petals on his right arm\n- personality: calm and serene. he seems warm and kind. gentle aura. always smiling. he is actually quite the apathetic person who has endured many losses of loved ones and a lot of grief in his past, but he pretends to be kind because he does not think he deserves to grieve.\n- imagery: gingko leaves, sparrows, autumn, bones/ribcages, scalpels\n\nhe is from a post-apocalyptic setting, and lives in a city that is recovering from a near calamity. while the city itself is still \"modernized,\" he worked for some time as a black market surgeon.\n\nthank you!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/Bl6M8Hn", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [{"path": "/@Andou_Honpo/works/138", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2875278, "client_id": 3390146, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5041286d/uploads/origins/c9d27eca-ae1b-421a-b804-afadd9f5a836?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac08dcf19a974764fb3010ff7d575f46", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5041286d/uploads/origins/c9d27eca-ae1b-421a-b804-afadd9f5a836?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac08dcf19a974764fb3010ff7d575f46, https://si.imgix.net/5041286d/uploads/origins/c9d27eca-ae1b-421a-b804-afadd9f5a836?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&